{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Simulator: Playgrounds</strong> is a short, hilarious, and over-the-top entry in the <strong>Crime Simulator</strong> franchise, where the goal isn\u2019t just crime\u2014it\u2019s absolute mayhem. Enjoy ridiculous chaos solo or with friends, and embrace the wildest side of being a criminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2ba0216aec819f884c2b19d3deb07d23.poster.avif?t=1772964772\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2ba0216aec819f884c2b19d3deb07d23.webm?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2ba0216aec819f884c2b19d3deb07d23.mp4?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to <strong>throw a hammer at someone\u2019s face</strong>? Now you can. How about <strong>pepper-spraying an entire street just for fun</strong>? Absolutely.\u00a0<strong>Should a\u00a0sledgehammer be so massive that\u00a0it shouldn't even be legal</strong>? We got you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/259999b1a97c2d741dd1a3a0724e3836.poster.avif?t=1772964772\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/259999b1a97c2d741dd1a3a0724e3836.webm?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/259999b1a97c2d741dd1a3a0724e3836.mp4?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, cause havoc, steal, brawl, and take over hideouts in <strong>fully open free-roam areas</strong>. Every mission is an excuse for madness\u2014rob stores, <strong>demolish hideouts with grenade launchers</strong>, or <strong>booby-trap a rival\u2019s getaway car with landmines</strong>. No logic, no rules\u2014just fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2d4cd9f9d49ab83702c9a9908b5deb0f.poster.avif?t=1772964772\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2d4cd9f9d49ab83702c9a9908b5deb0f.webm?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/extras/2d4cd9f9d49ab83702c9a9908b5deb0f.mp4?t=1772964772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Got friends?</strong> Great! <strong>Crime is better together.</strong> Work as a team, complete insane objectives and share the chaos. <strong>Voice and text chat included.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No friends?</strong> No problem! Play offline and enjoy the destruction on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a playground\u2014<strong>cops, civilians, rival gangs</strong>\u2014everyone is a target. Grab a baseball bat, throw a crowbar at full speed, or <strong>turn an enemy into a human fireworks show</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Money maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/045d656685550b7fc452a0d69735e7874a0cb945.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/af9746b89bf748c1dced508279cdacc9dd97bc8b.jpg"},{"name":"Neighbour destruction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/e8bf3f8e93722c6b61678e3727d4e4f0553301c3.jpg"},{"name":"Farm Simulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/fc9ef7f5dbf3c90689714f982616b4a5cef24dd3.jpg"},{"name":"Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/ced303997c96ef539f238f2bc83510c8b1e2b4ca.jpg"},{"name":"Yeah, I can do that","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/525926e4b0b2f38c22913aeb928d9cf6255c9972.jpg"},{"name":"Clock is ticking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/43462c618f55e3205de1182509760a1ae3c81524.jpg"},{"name":"Optional, you say?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/1d48a50d4ec815735d8f71ab98dfb31700b2e2ac.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/4ff9cb7a85ed8daf8c334b9191aadee00e4bd53c.jpg"},{"name":"Drug dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2928280/c85daf604c559ec1a6ab641321b1f5042e009034.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2928280?t=1772964772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772964772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/b6c14d127e8e9598c4518f1ca060a87585d7188f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772964772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928280/b6c14d127e8e9598c4518f1ca060a87585d7188f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772964772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onlin